    "body": "Maintainer, 2026-11-12: GitHub Pages is enabled (source: GitHub Actions) and the `github-pages` environment now lets `v*.*.0` tags deploy (it allowed only `main`, which would have refused every tag run). The `pages` job of the v0.18.0 release run, which had failed with \"Ensure GitHub Pages has been enabled\", was re-run and deployed the site built from the v0.18.0 tree: https://neotech.github.io/Camcraft/ . From here every release tag redeploys it. The browser build under the site is tracked in #1103.",
